Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,Main,0,0,0,,---- Main ----
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.55,0:00:07.85,Top,Game,0,0,0,,第一回合！ 開戰！
Dialogue: 1,0:00:05.55,0:00:07.85,Top-English,Game,0,0,0,,Round one! Fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.80,0:00:22.99,Top,Game,0,0,0,,K.O.!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.43,0:00:29.53,Text,Glasses Guy,0,0,0,,喂 你也放點水吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.53,0:00:31.55,Text,Brown-Haired Guy,0,0,0,,咦！？ 但是前輩
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.55,0:00:34.63,Text,Brown-Haired Guy,0,0,0,,你不是說在遊樂場放水的傢伙 沒資格當玩家嗎…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.63,0:00:38.76,Text,Glasses Guy,0,0,0,,你這笨蛋！ 把女生弄哭的傢伙 連人都沒資格當！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.76,0:00:41.05,Text,Brown-Haired Guy,0,0,0,,我… 我明白了…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.79,0:00:43.77,Text,Brown-Haired Guy,0,0,0,,可是該怎麼做…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.77,0:00:48.02,Text,Brown-Haired Guy,0,0,0,,看她這麼外行 我也只能不設防地往前走了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.45,0:00:49.28,Top,Cat,0,0,0,,喵！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.54,0:00:51.33,Text,Glasses Guy,0,0,0,,很好！ 這樣應該行得通…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.37,0:00:56.65,Text,Glasses Guy,0,0,0,,你放水被看穿啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.85,0:00:58.51,Text,Glasses Guy,0,0,0,,嘖 換我來！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.51,0:00:59.16,Text,Brown-Haired Guy,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.55,0:01:02.16,Text,Glasses Guy,0,0,0,,我來教你什麼是真正放水的技巧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.42,0:01:05.19,Text,Glasses Guy,0,0,0,,故意放出大絕招 讓對方以為自己躲開了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.19,0:01:08.33,Text,Glasses Guy,0,0,0,,然後要表現得很自然地 像被對方的空揮打中一樣！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.33,0:01:09.45,Text,Glasses Guy,0,0,0,,這樣一來…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.19,0:01:15.25,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,咦？ 男子漢模式…
Dialogue: 1,0:01:13.19,0:01:15.25,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Ah? OTOKOGI MODE...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.38,0:01:18.22,Text,Glasses Guy,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.37,0:01:31.64,Text,Glasses Guy,0,0,0,,她臉上流露出彷彿流了一身汗的舒暢表情！ 成功了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.49,0:01:35.00,Text,Glasses Guy,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.00,0:01:36.70,Text,Brown-Haired Guy,0,0,0,,是啊 太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.11,0:01:38.78,High,Lily,0,0,0,,蓮司 你看到了嗎！？
Dialogue: 1,0:01:37.11,0:01:38.78,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Renji, did you see that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.71,0:03:35.23,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,那個… 請問妳怎麼了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.70,0:03:35.23,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.47,0:03:39.08,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,不… 不是的！ 我沒做什麼虧心事 請相信我！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.08,0:03:40.99,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,請… 請妳冷靜點！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.38,0:03:46.37,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,遇到這種情況 請直接找店員幫忙
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.72,0:03:47.47,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,來
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.47,0:03:50.51,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,對… 對不起 謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.51,0:03:50.87,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.17,0:03:51.87,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.54,0:03:55.37,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,啊 妳是…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.67,0:03:58.67,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,同系的望月桃子同學對吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.69,0:04:02.08,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,你認錯人了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.08,0:04:04.39,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,妳幹嘛說這種兩秒就會被拆穿的謊啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.20,0:04:07.61,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,你不會在大學裡到處宣揚
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.61,0:04:10.69,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,說有個女的很難看地在地上撿零錢吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.69,0:04:11.63,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,才不會！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.13,0:04:14.46,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,妳把我當成什麼人了？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.46,0:04:16.28,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,太好了…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.28,0:04:18.95,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,話說回來 草壁同學你怎麼會在這裡？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.15,0:04:22.11,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,我在這裡打工
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.11,0:04:23.15,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,打工！？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.48,0:04:26.91,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,原來是這樣 所以你才沒參加社團
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.89,0:04:31.03,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,妳怎麼知道我沒參加社團？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.90,0:04:34.30,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,不… 不是！ 那個是… 這個…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.30,0:04:36.20,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,那… 那個 我先走了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.20,0:04:37.16,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,咦！？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.81,0:04:40.75,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,她到底是怎麼回事…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.03,0:04:58.93,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,草壁同學…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.93,0:05:01.77,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,他竟然還記得我的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.05,0:05:12.67,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,悄悄地…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.19,0:05:26.95,Text,Female Customer,0,0,0,,啊 真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.95,0:05:27.93,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,我來幫妳撿
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.93,0:05:29.22,Text,Female Customer,0,0,0,,啊 不用…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.49,0:05:32.94,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,沒關係的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.11,0:05:53.85,Flashback,Renji,0,0,0,,來
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.24,0:05:55.99,Flashback,Renji,0,0,0,,這樣就都撿起來了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.06,0:06:02.28,Flashback,Renji,0,0,0,,那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.28,0:06:05.87,Flashback,Momoko,0,0,0,,呀！ 對… 對不起！ 謝謝你！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.38,0:06:10.58,Flashback,Renji,0,0,0,,不會 下次小心點喔
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.45,0:06:22.53,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,雖然之後一直很在意他
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.99,0:06:27.21,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,但終究還是沒能跟他說上話…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.90,0:06:32.84,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,沒想到會在偶然進來的遊樂場再次遇到他
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.40,0:06:37.98,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,如果我也常來這裡的話 是不是就能跟他變熟呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.09,0:06:47.63,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,咦？ 總覺得剛才好像有人在看我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.91,0:06:53.75,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,那個娃娃是…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.95,0:07:07.69,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,好難喔 不知道是不是有什麼訣竅
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.69,0:07:12.46,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,啊 如果去問草壁同學的話 他說不定會教我一些訣竅！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.61,0:07:13.74,High,Lily,0,0,0,,我可以試試看嗎？
Dialogue: 1,0:07:12.61,0:07:13.74,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Can I have a go?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.42,0:07:20.46,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,對… 對不起！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.01,0:07:31.97,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,我看見了 我看見了她身上散發著類似氣場的東西！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.22,0:07:33.69,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,我敢肯定
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.17,0:07:36.72,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,這個女孩一定是遊樂場的…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.72,0:07:37.46,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,高手！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.01,0:08:05.52,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,那個女孩…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.60,0:08:11.85,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,到底是怎麼回事啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.98,0:08:21.57,Top,Janken Game,0,0,0,,剪刀石頭布！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.01,0:08:23.38,Top,Janken Game,0,0,0,,你輸了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.94,0:08:26.64,Top,Janken Game,0,0,0,,剪刀石頭布！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.11,0:08:28.61,Top,Janken Game,0,0,0,,你輸了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.97,0:08:30.59,Top,Janken Game,0,0,0,,剪刀石頭布！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.45,0:08:33.51,Top,Janken Game,0,0,0,,再來一次！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.51,0:08:34.99,Top,Janken Game,0,0,0,,你輸了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.81,0:08:40.63,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,輸得真慘…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.63,0:08:44.31,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,那個 莉莉 妳已經沒有代幣了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.31,0:08:45.38,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.74,0:08:46.41,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.51,0:08:49.98,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,妳倒是賺了不少代幣呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.88,0:08:55.36,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,也… 也還好啦 這種東西只要抓到訣竅就很簡單了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.36,0:08:58.64,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,其實是因為我上網查過攻略了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.74,0:09:05.26,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,啊！ 我不是說莉莉妳很遜喔！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.26,0:09:08.52,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,我們再去換一些代幣吧？ 好嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.52,0:09:09.69,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.69,0:09:12.30,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,那個… 請問能幫我一下嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.07,0:09:20.69,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,雖然總是只玩夾娃娃機 但代幣遊戲也很好玩呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.69,0:09:21.34,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.34,0:09:23.88,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,只要 100 圓就可以玩很多種遊戲了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.88,0:09:28.79,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,是啊 所以… 就算只是在遊樂場多待一會兒 我也覺得很開心！
Dialogue: 1,0:09:23.88,0:09:28.79,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,{\pos(426,945)}Ah-hah So...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:23.88,0:09:28.79,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,{\pos(1094,945)}SUKOSHI
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.09,0:09:32.79,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,也可以跟葵衣玩久一點
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.79,0:09:33.74,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,心動！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.29,0:09:37.06,Comment,Aoi,0,0,0,,※ YouTuber 戌神沁音（{\fnNoto Sans CJK JP}戌神ころね{\r}）在 2020 年與森美聲（{\fnNoto Sans CJK JP}森カリオペ{\r}）合作直\N　 播時無意中喊出的句子，此後成為迷因
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.29,0:09:37.06,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,我要死了 永遠感謝妳
Dialogue: 1,0:09:34.29,0:09:37.06,Text-English,Aoi,0,0,0,,I'm die. Thank you forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.06,0:09:37.99,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,咦 什麼？
Dialogue: 1,0:09:37.06,0:09:37.99,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Uh, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.99,0:09:41.31,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,能跟莉莉妳一起玩 我也很開心喔
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.31,0:09:44.06,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,我也很高興喔 葵衣！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.06,0:09:45.80,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,開心 開心！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.27,0:09:47.05,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.25,0:09:49.06,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,哎呀…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.06,0:09:50.57,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,那不是…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.57,0:09:51.62,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.06,0:09:56.57,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,莉莉！ 那個… 接待客人也是店員的工作啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.92,0:10:01.08,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,聽說那個人是同大學的同學
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.36,0:10:08.37,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,咦 是喔…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.83,0:10:15.38,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,那不就表示她可能會成為莉莉的情敵嗎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.38,0:10:18.35,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,在女性魅力這方面的戰力差距 實在是令人絕望啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.16,0:10:24.46,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,啊！ 她… 她走過來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.46,0:10:25.24,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.22,0:10:26.81,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.81,0:10:27.85,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,等… 欸！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.15,0:10:30.88,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,啊 妳是那個時候的…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.88,0:10:34.59,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,我還以為是遊樂場高手 結果好像不是的女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.25,0:10:38.23,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,請問… 有什麼事嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.91,0:10:45.41,High,Lily,0,0,0,,妳跟他究竟是什麼關係？
Dialogue: 1,0:10:42.91,0:10:45.41,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,What exactly is your relationship with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.87,0:10:50.12,High,Lily,0,0,0,,我先聲明 我們約過會 我也去過他家裡！
Dialogue: 1,0:10:45.87,0:10:50.12,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Just so you know, we've been on a date and I've popped over to his house before!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.62,0:10:56.14,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,咦！？ 莉莉跟他的關係已經進展到那種程度了嗎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.43,0:10:59.16,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,那現在這個狀況不就更像是…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.93,0:11:02.39,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.51,0:11:06.64,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,哀 康諾特 斯批苦 英格里咻
Dialogue: 1,0:11:03.51,0:11:06.64,Comment,Momoko,0,0,0,,※ I can not speak English.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.64,0:11:08.77,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,結果她根本聽不懂！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.40,0:11:11.23,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,瞥
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.89,0:11:15.90,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,那是什麼眼神！ 是要我幫她翻譯嗎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.15,0:11:18.08,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,盯——
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.42,0:11:28.66,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.66,0:11:32.19,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,她在問妳要不要一起玩代幣遊戲
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.19,0:11:32.67,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,咦！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.98,0:11:36.80,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,真的嗎？ 我一個人玩正覺得孤單 真是太好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.43,0:11:45.51,High,Lily,0,0,0,,原來如此… 妳要我們用遊戲一決勝負
Dialogue: 1,0:11:41.43,0:11:45.51,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,I see.... You mean we should settle this with games.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.65,0:11:47.82,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,真不愧是妳呢 葵衣！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.82,0:11:49.44,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,總算是撐過去了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.46,0:11:51.72,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,跟我來！
Dialogue: 1,0:11:50.46,0:11:51.72,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.72,0:11:52.51,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.56,0:11:55.41,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,唉…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.41,0:11:57.15,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,好想回家…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.48,0:11:59.29,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.94,0:12:01.27,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,莉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.73,0:12:03.25,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,那邊是…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.18,0:12:15.84,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,開始吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.22,0:12:17.09,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,好！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.75,0:12:19.76,Top,Janken Game,0,0,0,,剪刀石頭布！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.76,0:12:21.54,Top,Janken Game,0,0,0,,再來一次！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.96,0:12:23.41,Top,Janken Game,0,0,0,,你輸了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.29,0:12:28.35,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,一場奇妙的女人戰爭就此展開
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.87,0:12:30.65,Top,Janken Game,0,0,0,,剪刀石頭布！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.65,0:12:31.85,Top,Janken Game,0,0,0,,你輸了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.44,0:12:35.32,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,哇 妳們兩個人的代幣都已經用完了！？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.98,0:12:39.84,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,為什麼妳們一直玩猜拳遊戲啦！？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.84,0:12:41.75,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,嗯… 這個嘛…
Dialogue: 1,0:12:39.84,0:12:41.75,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Um, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.75,0:12:43.92,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,因為感覺好像很好贏…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.92,0:12:46.96,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,這個猜拳遊戲強得離譜 根本贏不了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.96,0:12:48.78,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,妳們應該試試別的才對！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.78,0:12:49.37,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,可是…
Dialogue: 1,0:12:48.78,0:12:49.37,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.70,0:12:52.86,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,想贏的話 就該去玩推幣機之類的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.29,0:12:58.37,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,玩這種遊戲 挑選機台是有訣竅的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.70,0:13:00.02,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,總之 妳們看好了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.02,0:13:02.21,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,請… 請務必讓我們學習
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.24,0:13:09.89,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,比我想像中賺得還多！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.89,0:13:11.58,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,妳好厲害喔
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.58,0:13:13.40,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,沒有啦 只是碰巧而已
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.75,0:13:15.40,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,哇 好厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.40,0:13:16.51,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,你什麼時候來的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.51,0:13:18.65,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,只是運氣好而已啦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.89,0:13:21.61,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,不 運氣也是實力的一種
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.61,0:13:23.41,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,真的很了不起
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.33,0:13:27.64,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,真… 真的嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.41,0:13:34.27,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,不是的 莉莉 妳誤會了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.27,0:13:34.70,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,哼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.70,0:13:37.67,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,喂！ 妳要去哪裡啊 莉莉！？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.67,0:13:39.38,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,去玩猜拳遊戲
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.38,0:13:42.17,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,就說了那個贏不了啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.17,0:13:45.33,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,哎呀 別鬧彆扭啦 莉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.58,0:13:47.81,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,好可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.02,0:13:49.95,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,對啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.60,0:13:58.19,High,Lily,0,0,0,,我們待會就回來
Dialogue: 1,0:13:56.60,0:13:58.19,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Be back in a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.23,0:14:00.85,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,早安 莉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.85,0:14:02.36,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,早安！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.36,0:14:10.41,High,Lily,0,0,0,,今天沒問題！ 我跟朋友一起去！
Dialogue: 1,0:14:07.36,0:14:10.41,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,I'll be fine for today! I'm going with some mates!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.58,0:14:13.94,High,Lily,0,0,0,,沒！事！的！
Dialogue: 1,0:14:12.58,0:14:13.94,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,It's! All! Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.79,0:14:17.71,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,真… 真的沒問題嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.71,0:14:18.62,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,沒問題的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.91,0:14:40.35,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,是說沒想到那個店員 會有這麼漂亮的大學同學呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.38,0:14:50.86,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,沒問題的！ 是莉莉的話 不管來什麼情敵都能贏！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.28,0:14:55.12,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,我可是知道莉莉有很多優點的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.73,0:14:58.05,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,葵衣…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.81,0:15:03.54,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,聽好了 這種時候就要不焦不躁 要展現出女人的從容！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.54,0:15:04.37,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,嗯嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.64,0:15:06.88,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,我為妳加油！
Dialogue: 1,0:15:04.64,0:15:06.88,Text-English,Aoi,0,0,0,,I'm cheer for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.88,0:15:08.37,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,謝謝…！
Dialogue: 1,0:15:06.88,0:15:08.37,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Thanks...!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.67,0:15:11.38,High,Lily,0,0,0,,我會為他而戰！
Dialogue: 1,0:15:09.67,0:15:11.38,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,I'll try fighting for him!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.57,0:15:13.40,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,對！ 戰鬥吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.40,0:15:14.45,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.86,0:15:15.17,Top,Aoi,0,0,0,,哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.09,0:15:28.04,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,不行啊 莉莉！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.04,0:15:30.52,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,再這樣下去你的身體會撐不住的！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.37,0:15:35.47,High,Lily,0,0,0,,不要阻止我 蓮司
Dialogue: 1,0:15:33.37,0:15:35.47,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Don't stop me, Renji.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.53,0:15:40.68,High,Lily,0,0,0,,這場戰鬥我不能輸！
Dialogue: 1,0:15:36.53,0:15:40.68,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,I can't lose this battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.37,0:15:54.16,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,妳是不是搞錯戰鬥對象了啊 莉莉？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.04,0:15:58.88,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,莉莉 妳還是放棄吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.18,0:16:02.44,High,Lily,0,0,0,,…不行 我不能放棄
Dialogue: 1,0:15:59.18,0:16:02.44,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,... No, I can't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.44,0:16:03.90,High,Lily,0,0,0,,因為…
Dialogue: 1,0:16:02.44,0:16:03.90,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Because...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.94,0:16:07.31,High,Lily,0,0,0,,我絕對要拿到那個！
Dialogue: 1,0:16:04.94,0:16:07.31,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,I absolutely have to have that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.50,0:16:10.89,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,雖然我懂妳的心情…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.46,0:16:16.09,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,但妳的分數還差得遠呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.23,0:16:20.84,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,唉 70 分的門檻還真高呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.84,0:16:24.37,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,雖然我想幫妳 但我現在還在上班
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.37,0:16:25.57,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,嗚…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.21,0:16:27.96,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,請問發生什麼事了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.83,0:16:30.46,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,啊 望月同學
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.78,0:16:32.97,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,是她！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.97,0:16:33.72,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.96,0:16:36.48,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,ㄨ… ㄨㄤ … 王…？
Dialogue: 1,0:16:33.96,0:16:36.48,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Mo… Mots… Motzu…?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.48,0:16:39.09,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,汪… 望 … 望野…？
Dialogue: 1,0:16:36.48,0:16:39.09,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Mo… Mo? Mo-Mochi? Zu?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.62,0:16:42.74,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,呵呵 叫我桃子就可以了 莉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.74,0:16:45.10,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,桃子！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.51,0:16:47.60,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,是 莉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.00,0:16:50.06,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,啥！？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.52,0:16:54.26,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,就是這麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.63,0:16:57.98,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,原來如此 原來是為這件事而苦惱啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.30,0:17:01.32,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,如果不嫌棄的話 可以讓我來幫忙嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.01,0:17:04.87,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,情敵伸出了援手…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.87,0:17:07.35,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,好了 莉莉 妳打算怎麼做？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.35,0:17:09.12,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,真的嗎？ 謝謝妳！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.12,0:17:11.07,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,她居然爽快地接受了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.07,0:17:12.65,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,太好了呢 莉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.65,0:17:14.63,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,嗯嗯！ 拜託妳了 桃子
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.98,0:17:16.92,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,好的！ 我會加油的！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.92,0:17:18.19,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,耶！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.68,0:17:23.23,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,今天早上的宣戰宣言跑哪去了啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.92,0:17:27.01,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,那麼 我要上了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.31,0:17:33.57,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,啊… 不行啦 這個
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.31,0:17:36.16,Text,Glasses Guy,0,0,0,,不 那可不一定
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.16,0:17:37.03,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,誰啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.03,0:17:38.88,Text,Brown-Haired Guy,0,0,0,,咦？ 真的假的？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.88,0:17:39.79,Text,Glasses Guy,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.67,0:17:43.60,Comment,Glasses Guy,0,0,0,,※ 劍道中的一種上段架勢，左手在上，右手在下，雙手持劍，劍尖朝上，劍身略向\N　 左傾斜，重點在於保持身體的平衡和穩定，同時確保劍尖指向對方的要害。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.67,0:17:43.60,Text,Glasses Guy,0,0,0,,那個架式是「左諸手上段」…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.12,0:17:46.30,Text,Glasses Guy,0,0,0,,也就是說…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.68,0:17:47.89,Text,Glasses Guy,0,0,0,,是劍道！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.74,0:17:50.55,Top,Game,0,0,0,,Game start!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.29,0:17:52.80,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.69,0:18:04.91,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,喝！ 喝 喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.56,0:18:06.82,Top,Renji,0,0,0,,請不要把機台打壞了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.25,0:18:06.81,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,哇！ 喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.82,0:18:08.63,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.05,0:18:34.01,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,喝！ 喝！ 喔！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.41,0:18:38.52,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,完… 完美通關！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.36,0:18:40.63,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,好… 厲害…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.63,0:18:44.26,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,望月同學 妳到底是何方神聖啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.26,0:18:49.56,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,我家是開劍道館的… 我從小就被父親鍛鍊出來的喔
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.56,0:18:51.28,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,原… 原來如此
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.28,0:18:53.79,Text,Brown-Haired Guy,0,0,0,,唉呀 真是大開眼界！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.79,0:18:54.79,Text,Glasses Guy,0,0,0,,哼…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.79,0:18:57.76,Text,Glasses Guy,0,0,0,,看來不管什麼遊戲都有強者呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.40,0:19:00.11,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,那麼 這是獎品…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.67,0:19:01.52,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,來
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.57,0:19:07.69,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,那個… 請你把這個給莉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.69,0:19:10.16,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.52,0:19:14.12,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,那麼 來 給你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.28,0:19:22.91,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,哎呀呀
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.28,0:19:27.04,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,要展現出女人的從容喵
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.15,0:19:29.84,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.44,0:19:34.69,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,這次是託妳的福才拿到的 所以這個給妳！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.55,0:19:37.73,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,咦？ 這樣好嗎 莉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.73,0:19:39.01,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,當然！
Dialogue: 1,0:19:37.73,0:19:39.01,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.01,0:19:40.18,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.95,0:19:42.32,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,那應該沒關係吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.59,0:19:46.57,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,這就是妳所謂的展現從容嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.99,0:19:51.87,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,那麼 我就當作是今天的紀念收下了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.87,0:19:55.62,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,啊… 不過可以再讓我看一下下嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.62,0:19:57.59,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,啊 好的 沒問題
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.42,0:20:01.36,High,Lily,0,0,0,,嗯 果然是限定版
Dialogue: 1,0:19:58.42,0:20:01.36,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Yeah. Definitely a limited edition.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.61,0:20:04.91,High,Lily,0,0,0,,無尾熊先生的眼神比平常更英氣煥發
Dialogue: 1,0:20:01.61,0:20:04.91,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,I can tell Mr. Koala's eyes are more gallant than usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.05,0:20:08.56,Top,Lily,0,0,0,,雖然看得到它 但感覺不一樣了 畢竟已經不是我的了
Dialogue: 1,0:20:05.05,0:20:08.56,Top-English,Lily,0,0,0,,It's different and I see it. It's not mine, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.37,0:20:07.92,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,她還真是戀戀不捨…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.50,0:20:11.07,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,非常感謝
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.07,0:20:12.75,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,不客氣
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.84,0:20:16.86,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,咦？ 你還要繼續玩？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.24,0:20:21.23,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.57,0:20:24.47,High,Lily,0,0,0,,我不會輸的…！
Dialogue: 1,0:20:22.57,0:20:24.47,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna lose...!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.74,0:20:35.46,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,啥？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.50,0:20:36.09,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,啥？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.09,0:20:36.86,Text,Brown-Haired Guy,0,0,0,,啥？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.09,0:20:36.86,Top,Glasses Guy,0,0,0,,啥？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.86,0:20:37.94,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,哎呀
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.31,0:20:40.25,Top,Game,0,0,0,,Game start!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.29,0:20:42.50,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 1,0:20:41.29,0:20:42.50,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Meeen!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.50,0:20:47.00,Top,Lily,0,0,0,,喝！ 喝！
Dialogue: 1,0:20:42.50,0:20:47.00,Top-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Men! Men! Men!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.25,0:20:46.12,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,就說了那樣不行啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.12,0:20:47.76,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,莉莉 加油！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.63,0:20:53.26,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,嗚哇！
Dialogue: 1,0:20:48.63,0:20:53.26,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Aww, bloody hell! Meen! Meen!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.26,0:20:56.07,Top,Lily,0,0,0,,喝！ 喝！
Dialogue: 1,0:20:53.26,0:20:56.07,Top-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Men! Meen!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.19,0:21:00.62,Text,Narrator,0,0,0,,在那之後 桃子又玩了一次 贏到了第二個獎品
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.95,0:21:02.40,High,Lily,0,0,0,,Meeeeeen!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.95,0:21:02.40,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,喝—！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.26,0:21:09.15,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.15,0:21:12.78,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,是個超級可愛的孩子喔 就像洋娃娃一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.78,0:21:14.79,Text,Momoko's Mom,0,0,0,,是喔…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.79,0:21:17.82,Text,Momoko's Mom,0,0,0,,看來妳在那邊過得不錯嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.82,0:21:20.42,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,嗯！ 我過得很好喔
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.28,0:21:26.16,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,欸 可以讓我看看友藏嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.16,0:21:29.99,Text,Momoko's Mom,0,0,0,,真是的 妳還真是喜歡友藏呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.08,0:21:32.93,Text,Tomozo,0,0,0,,汪！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.93,0:21:34.99,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,友藏！ 好久不見！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.99,0:21:36.43,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,你過得好嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.71,0:21:39.50,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,你看這個孩子 是不是跟友藏長得很像？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.50,0:21:40.30,Text,Tomozo,0,0,0,,噗！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.54,0:21:42.15,Text,Momoko's Mom,0,0,0,,哈哈 很像耶 很像耶
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.15,0:21:45.34,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,友藏 你嚇到了嗎？ 抱歉抱歉！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.24,0:21:50.16,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,呵呵… 不過真的長得很像呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.16,0:21:52.18,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,友藏跟草壁同學
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.33,0:21:55.96,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,哈啾！
Comment: 0,0:01:52.01,0:01:52.01,Default,OP,0,0,0,,-- OP --
