Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.51,0:22:07.22,EDJP,ED,0,0,0,,Chance！ Chance！ Chance！ つかめ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.22,0:22:09.02,EDJP,ED,0,0,0,,Luck！ Luck！ Luck！ パワー
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.02,0:22:11.60,EDJP,ED,0,0,0,,Up！ Up！ Up！ Right Here, Right Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.52,0:22:14.40,EDJP,ED,0,0,0,,Fight！ Fight！ Fight！ 欲張れ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.40,0:22:15.52,EDJP,ED,0,0,0,,Beat Down！ Down！ Down！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.52,0:22:18.69,EDJP,ED,0,0,0,,いざEn-Joy！ Joy！ Joy！ Let's Get Over！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.69,0:22:22.53,EDJP,ED,0,0,0,,クレジット入れた瞬間に
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.41,0:22:26.16,EDJP,ED,0,0,0,,広がる世界 interaction
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.78,0:22:28.37,EDJP,ED,0,0,0,,What a fresh experience！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.37,0:22:31.33,EDJP,ED,0,0,0,,いつの間にかみんなで
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.33,0:22:33.46,EDJP,ED,0,0,0,,楽しんだり
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.79,0:22:36.84,EDJP,ED,0,0,0,,熱くなったり
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.30,0:22:40.22,EDJP,ED,0,0,0,,ハマったり
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.84,0:22:46.22,EDJP,ED,0,0,0,,ボコボコにやられてへこんだりと
Comment: 0,0:22:46.22,0:22:52.81,EDJP,ED,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k0}作る思い出　賑わうこの{\k0}空間|<ばしょ{\k0}で
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.22,0:22:52.81,EDJP,ED,0,0,0,,作る思い出　賑わうこの空間で
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.06,0:22:56.48,EDJP,ED,0,0,0,,たまには Like a superhero に
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.48,0:23:02.65,EDJP,ED,0,0,0,,誰でもなれるかもしれない
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.16,0:23:05.66,EDJP,ED,0,0,0,,Anytime we enjoy them！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.66,0:23:07.45,EDJP,ED,0,0,0,,Anytime we love it all！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.45,0:23:10.91,EDJP,ED,0,0,0,,日々更新される楽しさの理論値
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.91,0:23:12.75,EDJP,ED,0,0,0,,So here's the wonderland！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.75,0:23:14.37,EDJP,ED,0,0,0,,Why don't you come with me？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.37,0:23:18.29,EDJP,ED,0,0,0,,失敗してもう一回　次も一緒にね
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.29,0:23:20.17,EDJP,ED,0,0,0,,Chance！ Chance！ Chance！ つかめ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.17,0:23:21.88,EDJP,ED,0,0,0,,Luck！ Luck！ Luck！ パワー
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.88,0:23:24.43,EDJP,ED,0,0,0,,Up！ Up！ Up！ Right Here, Right Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.43,0:23:25.39,EDJP,ED,0,0,0,,(Oh my gosh！)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.39,0:23:28.39,EDJP,ED,0,0,0,,Uh！ Oh！ Oh！ もう It's Time Up！ Up！ Up！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.39,0:23:33.73,EDJP,ED,0,0,0,,それじゃまた明日もここで　See you again！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.51,0:22:07.22,EDCHT,ED,0,0,0,,Chance！ Chance！ Chance！  把握機會
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.22,0:22:09.02,EDCHT,ED,0,0,0,,Luck！ Luck！ Luck！ 充滿力量
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.02,0:22:11.60,EDCHT,ED,0,0,0,,Up！ Up！ Up！ Right Here, Right Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.52,0:22:14.40,EDCHT,ED,0,0,0,,Fight！ Fight！ Fight！ 不要吝嗇慾望
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.40,0:22:15.52,EDCHT,ED,0,0,0,,Beat Down！ Down！ Down！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.52,0:22:18.69,EDCHT,ED,0,0,0,,來吧 En-Joy！ Joy！ Joy！ Let's Get Over！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.69,0:22:22.53,EDCHT,ED,0,0,0,,投下代幣的那一瞬間
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.41,0:22:26.16,EDCHT,ED,0,0,0,,展開嶄新世界 interaction
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.78,0:22:28.37,EDCHT,ED,0,0,0,,What a fresh experience！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.37,0:22:31.33,EDCHT,ED,0,0,0,,不知不覺間大家也一起
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.33,0:22:33.46,EDCHT,ED,0,0,0,,享受其中
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.79,0:22:36.84,EDCHT,ED,0,0,0,,熱血沸騰
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.30,0:22:40.22,EDCHT,ED,0,0,0,,上癮不已
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.84,0:22:46.22,EDCHT,ED,0,0,0,,被虐得體無完膚 意志消沉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.22,0:22:52.81,EDCHT,ED,0,0,0,,但也一起創造回憶 在這熱鬧的空間中
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.06,0:22:56.48,EDCHT,ED,0,0,0,,偶爾 Like a superhero
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.48,0:23:02.65,EDCHT,ED,0,0,0,,說不定任何人都有機會成為主角
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.16,0:23:05.66,EDCHT,ED,0,0,0,,Anytime we enjoy them！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.66,0:23:07.45,EDCHT,ED,0,0,0,,Anytime we love it all！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.45,0:23:10.91,EDCHT,ED,0,0,0,,每天都在更新的樂趣理論值
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.91,0:23:12.75,EDCHT,ED,0,0,0,,So here's the wonderland！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.75,0:23:14.37,EDCHT,ED,0,0,0,,Why don't you come with me？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.37,0:23:18.29,EDCHT,ED,0,0,0,,即使失敗再一次 下次也一起挑戰吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.29,0:23:20.17,EDCHT,ED,0,0,0,,Chance！ Chance！ Chance！ 抓住它
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.17,0:23:21.88,EDCHT,ED,0,0,0,,Luck！ Luck！ Luck！ 是力量
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.88,0:23:24.43,EDCHT,ED,0,0,0,,Up！ Up！ Up！ Right Here, Right Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.43,0:23:25.39,EDCHT,ED,0,0,0,,（Oh my gosh！）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.39,0:23:28.39,EDCHT,ED,0,0,0,,Uh！ Oh！ Oh！ 已經 It's Time Up！ Up！ Up！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.39,0:23:33.73,EDCHT,ED,0,0,0,,那麼明天再來這裡見吧 See you again！
